{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["And the disputants said that בן שנה is not like בן שנתו, for בן שנתו still does not have a year, while בן שנה is one that has a complete year. Now they did not call it, in the dedication of the altar, 'a lamb, בן שנתו, for a burnt offering,' and in another passage 'twelve lambs, בני שנה.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:51.969901006Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}